1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,624
White clothes turned yellow?

2
00:00:01,915 --> 00:00:04,422
Skip the harsh bleach and try this.

3
00:00:04,633 --> 00:00:05,155
One.

4
00:00:05,388 --> 00:00:07,978
Rub dish soap and baking soda paste into

5
00:00:07,988 --> 00:00:09,334
the yellow areas.

6
00:00:09,533 --> 00:00:10,182
Two.

7
00:00:10,473 --> 00:00:12,530
Soak in hot water with half a cup

8
00:00:12,540 --> 00:00:15,163
of baking soda for one to two hours.

9
00:00:15,367 --> 00:00:16,063
Three.

10
00:00:16,296 --> 00:00:18,745
Wash, then dry in the sun.

11
00:00:18,978 --> 00:00:20,719
Never mix with bleach.

12
00:00:20,933 --> 00:00:22,616
Full guide on the channel.
